.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare tool versions with manovaspace/ci/ci/versions.env


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for versions


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the report as a JSON envelope


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-audit(1)\fP
